Demo saga implementation

Usage: demo-provision <COMMAND>

Commands:
  dot        Dump a dot (graphviz) representation of the saga graph
  info       Dump information about the saga graph (not an execution)
  print-log  Pretty-print the log from a previous execution
  run        Execute the saga
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
